  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds the OnAdPlayRewarded event and AdPlayRewardedEventArgs, AdConfig.UserId for rewarded server-to-server callbacks (%user% via /ri), and AdEndEventArgs.MSFTNotify / AdEndEventArgs.CallToActionClicked. The /config response parser now reads both the v5 and v7 shapes. BREAKING: LiftoffRewarded, LiftoffInterstitial and LiftoffBanner have been removed -- use AdConfig.UserId in place of LiftoffRewarded.UserId. BREAKING: the AdEndEventArgs constructor now requires msftNotify and callToActionClicked. DEPRECATED: AdStartEventArgs.CampaignID -- use CreativeID; the campaign id goes permanently empty at SDK 7.4.0.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "Vungle SDK for WinForms",
  "verbatimVersion": "7.1.0",
